{
  "name": "WF-04 Review Queue Notification",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 18 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Daily at 18:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $env.GOOGLE_SHEET_ID }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "CONTACTS"
        },
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "review_status",
              "lookupValue": "NEEDS_REVIEW"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "get-needs-review",
      "name": "Get NEEDS_REVIEW Contacts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [460, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER",
          "name": "Google Sheets OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-items",
              "leftValue": "={{ $input.all().length }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "check-items",
      "name": "Check Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst count = items.length;\nlet html = `<h2>Review Queue Digest</h2><p>You have <strong>${count}</strong> contacts pending manual review in Google Sheets.</p><ul>`;\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < Math.min(10, count); i++) {\n  const row = items[i].json;\n  html += `<li><strong>${row.hotel_id || 'Unknown Hotel'}</strong> - ${row.email} (${row.email_type})<br/><em>Groq Reason:</em> ${row.groq_reason || 'N/A'}</li>`;\n}\n\nif (count > 10) {\n  html += `<li><em>...and ${count - 10} more.</em></li>`;\n}\nhtml += `</ul><p>Please open the Google Sheet, review them, and change status to <strong>READY_TO_SEND</strong> or <strong>REJECTED</strong>.</p>`;\n\nreturn [{ json: { count, html } }];"
      },
      "id": "format-digest",
      "name": "Format Digest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [900, 280]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $env.SENDER_EMAIL }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.count }} contacts need manual review",
        "message": "={{ $json.html }}",
        "appendAttribution": false,
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "send-email",
      "name": "Send Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1120, 280],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "PLACEHOLDER",
          "name": "Gmail OAuth2"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-04 Review Queue\n\n**Trigger:** Daily at 18:00\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Gets all contacts marked `NEEDS_REVIEW`.\n2. If there are any, prepares an HTML digest.\n3. Sends an email to the admin (`SENDER_EMAIL`) reminding them to review the Google Sheet.\n4. Admin manually changes `NEEDS_REVIEW` to `READY_TO_SEND` or `REJECTED` in Google Sheets.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 240
      },
      "id": "note-review",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 520]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily at 18:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get NEEDS_REVIEW Contacts",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get NEEDS_REVIEW Contacts": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Items",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Items": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Digest",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Digest": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "errorWorkflow": "WF-99 Error Handler"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "tags": []
}
